  "text": "View on Google Maps\nContact Us\n20 West 47th Street, Lower Level #24\nNew York, NY 10036\n+1 646-362-3536\n[email protected]\nWho We Are\nBullion Trading LLC is a premier New York-based bullion dealer, serving as your trusted destination for buying, selling, and trading precious metals since 2008.\nWe specialize in high-quality gold, silver, platinum, and palladium bars and coins, ensuring the highest standards of purity and authenticity in every transaction.\nOur commitment to excellence, transparent pricing, and exceptional customer service makes us the go-to partner for discerning investors and collectors in the bullion market worldwide.",
